title: 'pallet-recovery: add do_try_state invariant checks'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |
    Adds a `do_try_state` implementation to `pallet-recovery`, wired into the
    `try_state` runtime hook. It checks eight state-consistency invariants over
    `Attempt`, `FriendGroups`, and `Inheritor` storage: orphan-attempt absence,
    in-range friend-group index, well-formed approval bitfields, approval count
    within threshold, block-ordering, per-entry deposit holds, and the
    inheritor-is-not-the-lost-account precondition. Inheritor overridability is
    checked as a warning. Covered by unit tests.
crates:
- name: pallet-recovery
  bump: patch
